# Use the subclass mock maker instead of the inline one.
#
# The inline maker needs a JVM agent, and self-attachment is not permitted on every
# JDK 21+ build — where it is not, every Mockito-based test fails at class
# initialisation with "no working agent attachment mechanism". Nothing here mocks a
# final class, a final method, or a static, so the subclass maker is sufficient and
# removes the dependency on agent attachment entirely.
mock-maker-subclass
